Shortcut Trick
यदि tan x = cot y, तो उनके कोण पूरक होते हैं: x + y = 90&deg;

दिया गया है: tan A = cot(2A &minus; 30&deg;)

&rArr; A + (2A &minus; 30&deg;) = 90&deg;

&rArr; 3A = 120&deg;

&rArr; A = 40&deg;

**&there4; सही उत्तर 40&deg; है।**

**Alternate Method**

**दिया गया है:**

tan A = cot(2A &minus; 30&deg;)

**प्रयुक्त सूत्र:**

cot &theta; = tan(90&deg; &minus; &theta;)




  A

  2A &minus; 30&deg;
  Adjacent to A
  Opposite to A
  If tan x = cot y, then x + y = 90&deg;

**गणना:**

&rArr; tan A = tan(90&deg; &minus; (2A &minus; 30&deg;))

दोनों पक्षों के कोणों की तुलना करने पर:

&rArr; A = 90&deg; &minus; (2A &minus; 30&deg;)

&rArr; A = 90&deg; &minus; 2A + 30&deg;

&rArr; A + 2A = 120&deg;

&rArr; 3A = 120&deg;

&rArr; A = 40&deg;

**&there4; सही उत्तर 40&deg; है।**

**Additional Information**

पूरक कोण सर्वसमिकाएँ

sin(90&deg; &minus; &theta;) = cos &theta; | tan(90&deg; &minus; &theta;) = cot &theta; | sec(90&deg; &minus; &theta;) = cosec &theta;

संपूरक कोण सर्वसमिकाएँ

sin(180&deg; &minus; &theta;) = sin &theta; | cos(180&deg; &minus; &theta;) = &minus;cos &theta; | tan(180&deg; &minus; &theta;) = &minus;tan &theta;

ऋणात्मक कोण सर्वसमिकाएँ

sin(&minus;&theta;) = &minus;sin &theta; | cos(&minus;&theta;) = cos &theta; | tan(&minus;&theta;) = &minus;tan &theta;
